r: rgb(255,255,255);font-size: 24px;font-family: SassoonInfantRg-Regular;\">be as tall as a house or as small as a mouse? </span></li>\n<li style=\"margin-left:1.5em;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);background-color: rgb(255,255,255);font-size: 24px;font-family: SassoonInfantRg-Regular;\">have hands instead of feet or a tail? </span></li>\n<li style=\"margin-left:1.5em;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);background-color: rgb(255,255,255);font-size: 24px;font-family: SassoonInfantRg-Regular;\">be able to see through walls or read people’s minds? </span></li>\n<li style=\"margin-left:1.5em;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);background-color: rgb(255,255,255);font-size: 24px;font-family: SassoonInfantRg-Regular;\">eat ice cream for every meal or never eat ice cream again? </span></li>\n<li style=\"margin-left:1.5em;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);background-color: rgb(255,255,255);font-size: 24px;font-family: SassoonInfantRg-Regular;\">be itchy for the rest of your life or sticky for the rest of your life? </span></li>\n<li style=\"margin-left:1.5em;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);background-color: rgb(255,255,255);font-size: 24px;font-family: SassoonInfantRg-Regular;\">travel back in time or into the future? </span></li>\n</ul>\n", "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": false, "selectedModalId": 0, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}], "details": {"id": 200, "name": "More question suggestions", "logCreatedAt": "2022-11-28T12:51:16.834043", "logUpdatedAt": "2022-11-28T12:51:16.834043", "logCreatedById": 21670528, "logUpdatedById": 21670528, "nameForContentDev": null}}, "order": 6, "btnType": "PRIMARY", "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "MODAL", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null